sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Musician
    participant UI as WebClient
    participant API as SignupController
    participant SS as SignupService
    participant MR as MusicianRepository
    participant EVR as EventRepository
    participant SR as SignupRepository
    participant DB as Database

    Note over M,DB: Scenario 4 - Musician tries to sign up twice for the same Event (UC-MUS-001 extension 2a, EARS-IF-001)
    Note over M,DB: Given Musician 1 exists, Event 1 exists and a Signup already exists for Musician 1 and Event 1

    activate M
    Note over M,UI: When Musician 1 attempts to sign up for Event 1 again
    M->>UI: clickSignUp(eventId=1, info=Available)
    activate UI
    UI->>API: POST /api/events/1/signups (info=Available)
    activate API
    API->>API: resolveMusicianId(sessionToken)
    API->>SS: createSignup(musicianId=1, eventId=1, info=Available)
    activate SS

    SS->>MR: findById(1)
    activate MR
    MR-->>SS: Musician(id=1)
    deactivate MR

    SS->>EVR: findById(1)
    activate EVR
    EVR-->>SS: Event(id=1, band_id=3, capacity=5, date)
    deactivate EVR

    SS->>SR: existsByMusicianIdAndEventId(1, 1)
    activate SR
    SR-->>SS: true
    deactivate SR

    alt a Signup for Musician 1 and Event 1 already exists (EARS-IF-001)
        SS-->>API: SignupRejected(ALREADY_SIGNED_UP)
        API-->>UI: 409 Conflict (Already signed up for this event)
        UI-->>M: showError(Already signed up for this event)
        Note over M,UI: Then the system rejects with error Already signed up for this event
    else pre-check passed (stale read or concurrent cancel, not exercised by this scenario)
        SS->>SR: insert(Signup(musician_id=1, event_id=1, info=Available))
        activate SR
        SR->>DB: INSERT INTO Signup (event_id, musician_id, info)
        activate DB
        alt UNIQUE(event_id, musician_id) violated (double submit race)
            DB-->>SR: UniqueViolation
            SR-->>SS: DuplicateSignupException
            SS-->>API: SignupRejected(ALREADY_SIGNED_UP)
            API-->>UI: 409 Conflict (Already signed up for this event)
            UI-->>M: showError(Already signed up for this event)
        else row inserted
            DB-->>SR: id=18
            SR-->>SS: Signup(id=18)
            SS-->>API: SignupCreated(signupId=18)
            API-->>UI: 201 Created
            UI-->>M: showConfirmation()
        end
        deactivate DB
        deactivate SR
    end

    deactivate SS
    deactivate API
    deactivate UI
    deactivate M
